  description: "The Cannon is one of the earliest automated defense systems still
    in active service. Originally mass-produced for orbital facilities and off-world
    colonies, its design prioritized reliability over innovation. While newer technologies
    emerged, the Cannon endured due to its simplicity and adaptability. It has become
    a symbol of humanity\u2019s first attempts at automated survival."
  vnDescription: "Cannon l\xE0 m\u1ED9t trong nh\u1EEFng h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng ph\xF2ng
    th\u1EE7 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA7u v\u1EABn c\xF2n ho\u1EA1t
    \u0111\u1ED9ng. Ban \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t h\xE0ng
    lo\u1EA1t cho c\xE1c c\u01A1 s\u1EDF tr\xEAn qu\u1EF9 \u0111\u1EA1o v\xE0 c\xE1c
    thu\u1ED9c \u0111\u1ECBa ngo\xE0i Tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EA5t, thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF c\u1EE7a
    n\xF3 \u01B0u ti\xEAn \u0111\u1ED9 tin c\u1EADy h\u01A1n l\xE0 s\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED5i
    m\u1EDBi. M\u1EB7c d\xF9 c\xE1c c\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7 m\u1EDBi h\u01A1n \u0111\xE3
    xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n, Cannon v\u1EABn t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i nh\u1EDD s\u1EF1 \u0111\u01A1n
    gi\u1EA3n v\xE0 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng th\xEDch \u1EE9ng c\u1EE7a n\xF3. N\xF3 \u0111\xE3
    tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng cho nh\u1EEFng n\u1ED7 l\u1EF1c \u0111\u1EA7u
    ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n lo\u1EA1i trong vi\u1EC7c t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng h\xF3a
    \u0111\u1EC3 sinh t\u1ED3n."
